# GitHub Actions

- **Lint:** Run `actionlint` on workflow files before finishing.
- **Project command:** `bun run lint:workflows` (uses system actionlint or `nix run nixpkgs#actionlint`).
- **Full check:** `bun run check` (includes actionlint). Use `check:with-links` to add lychee.
- **Workflow testing:** Prefer `bun run act` (nektos act) for local testing over pushing to CI. When creating a new branch to test workflow changes, update the SHA in `.github/workflows/auto-pr.yml` to the current commit (`git rev-parse HEAD`) so the workflow runs with the branch code.
- **Reusable actions:** Keep reusable actions runnable without Bun, repo `node_modules`, or imports from `src/**` at runtime. For auto-pr TypeScript/Effect workflow logic, prefer packaged commands in `src/workflow/` invoked through `auto-pr-run-command`; do not add generated `.mjs` bundles under `.github/actions/**`.
